message: "If you refer to this research program, please cite it as below."
title: "AIM²P: Research Program for Certified AI Reasoning in Mathematics and Mathematical Physics (Phase 0)"
abstract: >-
  Scientific foundations of AIM²P (African AI for Mathematics & Mathematical Physics):
  research question, state of the art, research gap and 2026–2028 roadmap for a
  neuro-symbolic architecture coupling LLM reasoning, SymPy symbolic computation and
  Lean 4 formal verification, with compiler-guided self-correction.
authors:
  - name: "AIM²P Initiative"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-17"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://github.com/AIM2P"
repository: "https://github.com/AIM2P/research"
keywords:
  - lean4
  - formal-verification
  - theorem-proving
  - neuro-symbolic
  - large-language-models
  - sympy
  - mathematical-physics
  - krylov-complexity
